{"id":"gamefreak-lineblog-4511791","kind":"blog","title":"【日记】2016年巴士扶手的理由","display_title":null,"dek":null,"date":"2016-06-27","publication":"増田順一 公式ブログ · ものの理由","issue":null,"interviewee":[],"people":[{"name":"增田顺一","slug":"masuda-junichi"}],"works":[],"era":null,"url":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/gamefreak-director/lineblog-4511791/","body_kind":"markdown","segment_count":null,"cover":null,"archive_type":"gamefreak_masuda_lineblog","summary":"一次乘坐巴士时对奇妙扶手产生兴趣，从颜色、材质到弯折结构，推理它为何如此设计。","interviewer":null,"translator":null,"tags":["Game Freak","增田顺一","LINE BLOG","ものづくり"],"original_lang":null,"translation_status":"openai-machine-translated","source":{"title":"増田順一 公式ブログ · ものの理由","url":"https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/4511791.html","archive_url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20160630110417id_/https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/4511791.html","type":"official_blog_wayback"},"body":{"kind":"markdown","markdown_zh":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">好久没</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">坐上巴士\n    <figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/001-7f9e6799bc.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/001-7f9e6799bc.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\"></a></figure>了</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">被这根柱子惊到了（笑）</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/002-e3c5ce73af.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/002-e3c5ce73af.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n从天花板把能量\n运送到座椅上似的\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n坐下的人的能量\n又像是被巴士的天花板吸走了似的\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n宝可梦 X・Y的\n\n伊裴尔塔尔、哲尔尼亚斯的\n\n活动舞台一样（笑）\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n奇妙的扶手\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n我很在意\n为什么会是那种\n形状，于是想了想！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n作为扶手\n为了让人一眼就看明白\n采用了橙色\n\n<br>\n\n\n为了不打滑\n同时也更卫生\n套上了橡胶外套\n\n<br>\n\n\n因为天花板的加固部分\n和座椅的安装部分错开了\n所以只能在中途把扶手弯折\n\n<br>\n\n\n其一\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\"></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\"></a></figure>    \n        <br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\"></a></figure>      \n        <br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\"></a></figure>         \n        <br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\"></a></figure>            \n        <br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\"></a></figure>               \n        <br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\"></a></figure>                  \n        <br>\n\n\n把猫想象成连在一起的哦！\n\n表现右侧的扶手！\n\n<br>\n\n\n这样一来\n作为扶手就不太好抓了\n\n<br>\n\n\n其二\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\"></a></figure> <br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\"></a></figure> <br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\"></a></figure> <br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\"></a></figure> <br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=