" height=\"15\"></a></figure>         \n        <br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\"></a></figure>         \n        <br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\"></a></figure>        \n        <br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\"></a></figure>        \n        <br>\n\n\n这样一来\n通道就会变窄\n\n<br>\n\n\n因此最终得出的\n就是这个弯了两次的形状\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\"></a></figure> <br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\"></a></figure>  \n        <br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\"></a></figure>         \n        <br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\"></a></figure>        \n        <br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\"></a></figure>         \n        <br>\n\n\n\n         \n        <figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\"></a></figure>                 \n        <br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\"></a></figure>                \n        <br>\n\n\n我觉得这是\n一根设计得恰到好处的扶手！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n任何东西\n都有它之所以呈现那种形状的\n理由吧！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n解开其中的谜团\n也是一件很开心的事！\n大家也一定要试试看！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n        下回再见！\n\n<br></div>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">久しぶりに</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">バス\n    <figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/001-7f9e6799bc.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/001-7f9e6799bc.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\"></a></figure>に乗って</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">この柱に驚きました（笑）</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/002-e3c5ce73af.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/002-e3c5ce73af.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n天井からエネルギーが\nイスに運ばれているような\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n座った人のエネルギーが\nバスの天井に吸われているような\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\nポケモン X・Yの\n\nイベルタル・ゼルネアスの\n\nイベントのステージのような（笑）\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n不思議な手すり\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nどうしてそんな\n形状なのか気になり\n考えて見ました！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n手すりとして\n分かりやすいように\nオレンジ色\n\n<br>\n\n\n滑らないように\nそして衛生的な\nゴムのカバー\n\n<br>\n\n\n天井の強化部分と\nイスの設置部分がズレているので\n途中で手すりを曲げるしかない\n\n<br>\n\n\nその1\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\"></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\"></a></figure>    \n        <br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\"></a></figure>      \n        <br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4511791/003-32cd74b08b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noope